diptheria, ebola, Covid;
Pressure on/increased demand for education;
Unemployment/high youth unemployment;
Specified pollution;
Increased/high crime rate;
etc.
Place-specific reference is likely to consist of:
Named places within the country;
Statistics;
etc.
